Inputs:

PPG analog signal
second PPG signal
ADC sampling data
Possibly battery/power status
user calibration coefficients

Processing:

ADC acquisition
Filtering
Signal conditioning
Heartbeat/peak detection
PPG timing detection
PTT calculation
BP estimation
Signal-quality checking

Outputs:

Systolic BP
Diastolic BP
PTT
Heart rate
Signal-quality/error status
Possibly raw/processed waveform data for debugging
